{
  "changelog": "Initial release of pharmacology-pmph-10edition:\n\n- Provides a clinical pharmacology skills handbook based on the 10th edition of \"Pharmacology\" (\u4eba\u6c11\u536b\u751f\u51fa\u7248\u793e).\n- Covers 180 core pharmacology skill modules, each with a dedicated SKILL.md file.\n- Includes classification and quick index for drug mechanisms, rational drug use, adverse effect management, special population dosing, anti-infective and antitumor strategies, and more.\n- Organized by major pharmacology topics such as cardiovascular, CNS, endocrine, anti-infectives, oncology, immunology, and clinical applications.\n- Aimed at medical students and professionals for study and reference.",
